e procedure is  big it's probably 80 to 90 percent take  on baby ray if the surgery surgery is  successful the emotional turmoil of  infertility in all its guises is well  documented the news of another pathway  to having a child of their own is  something else to cling on to for  couples across the world  Debbie Bowden Sky News
 

